sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as 3rd Party Client UI
    participant MW as Middleware API
    participant DB as Middleware Database
    participant HOBS as HOBS ERP
    participant SixD as 6D Billing Engine
    participant Mapp as Mapp Link Generator
    participant Notify as Notification Service (SMS/WA/Email)

    Client->>MW: POST /api/v1/onboarding/{prospectId}/payment-link
    MW->>HOBS: Synchronous Account Creation Request
    HOBS-->>MW: Return Account ID & Success Acknowledgement
    MW->>DB: Update State to HOBS_ACCOUNT_CREATED
    MW-->>Client: HTTP 202 Accepted (Return Account ID, start async job)
    
    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        note over MW, SixD: Asynchronous Billing Sync & Payment Link Gen
        loop Check 6D Sync (3 retries with backoff)
            MW->>SixD: GET /accounts/{accountId}/sync-status
            SixD-->>MW: Synced / Pending
        end
        alt Sync Success
            MW->>Mapp: POST /payment/link (Generate Link with Expiry)
            Mapp-->>MW: Return Payment Link & Expiry Time
            MW->>DB: Save Payment Link details, state = LINK_GENERATED
            MW->>Notify: Trigger SMS, WhatsApp & Email with payment link
        else Sync Fails after Retries
            MW->>DB: Update state = SYNC_FAILED
            MW->>Notify: Send SMS/Email alert to retry step 9
        end
    end
